  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted  therewith and numbered Design & Access Statement & 7740/01 to 7740/09 Received: 25 October 2010 and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - 3.\tThe site shall be used as a Further Education (D1 use) and for no other purpose (including any other purpose in Class D1 of the Schedule to the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987, or in any provision equivalent to that Class in any statutory instrument revoking and re-enacting that Order with or without modification).",
    "Condition : 5 - 5.\tWithin 4 months of the date of approval written confirmation must be provided to the Council of the applicant's commitment to undertake an iTRACE compliant site audit and staff/visitor travel survey to gauge current travel behaviour (standard audit form and survey attached). The survey must be rerun every two years for a total period of 5 years (so, years 1,3 and 5). The details shall be carried out as approved.",
    "Condition : 6 - Within 4 months of the date of approval details shall be submitted to the Local Planning Authority for approval for an action plan setting out (with SMART objectives and targets) how the applicant plans to communicate and promote sustainable transport options to staff and students - e.g. provision of bus route information, information about cycle training opportunities, salary sacrifice scheme etc.  Details should also be provided of a named travel plan coordinator to travelplans@hounslow.gov.uk.  This must be current at all times. The details shall be carried out as approved."
  ],
